.nh
.TH "PB-API-TOKEN-LIST" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-api-token-list - List API tokens


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb api-token list [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List the API tokens of the active workspace: your own, or every member's when
you are an owner or admin. The table shows each token's name, id, creator,
expiry, last use, state and whether a scope narrows it. Secrets are never
shown again after creation.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for list

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb api-token list
  pb api-token list --json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-api-token(1)\fP
